<section class="section" data-panel="dashboard"><section class="panel">
  <header class="panel-head"><div><h2>工作台</h2><p>继续编辑内容，查看审核与网站发布进度。</p></div><button class="button secondary" id="workspaceRefresh" type="button">更新状态</button></header>
  <div class="workspace-metrics">
    <article><span>待审核翻译</span><strong id="workspacePending">—</strong><button class="button secondary" data-workspace-target="product-drafts" type="button">查看翻译</button></article>
    <article><span>已审核，等待网站发布</span><strong id="workspaceUnpublished">—</strong><button class="button secondary" data-workspace-target="publish" type="button">查看网站发布</button></article>
    <article><span>翻译任务</span><strong id="workspaceTranslation">正在查询</strong><button class="button secondary" data-workspace-target="translation" type="button">查看任务</button></article>
  </div>
  <p id="workspaceStatus" class="status" role="status">正在确认待办状态，尚未取得结果。</p>
  <div class="workspace-shortcuts"><button class="button secondary" data-workspace-target="products" type="button">管理产品</button><button class="button secondary" data-workspace-target="blog" type="button">管理所有文章</button><button class="button secondary" data-workspace-target="visuals" type="button">更换站点图片</button></div>
</section></section>
